winnow-iso8601 began as a fork of the `iso8601` crate
(https://github.com/badboy/iso8601) and retains code from it. With thanks to
Jan-Erik Rediger and Hendrik Sollich for the original work, and to the
contributors who read the standard so the rest of us did not have to.

